<title>SWEDEN: Volvo Bus, TWR j/v to be 65 pct TWR-owned.</title>
<headline>Volvo Bus, TWR j/v to be 65 pct TWR-owned.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo's bus unit said on Wednesday it would set up a joint venture for bus production and components with TWR, a British automotive engineering consultancy group.</p>
<p>The joint venture would be 65 percent owned by TWR and 35 percent owned by the Volvo Bus Corporation, Volvo said in a statement.</p>
</text>
